From: Chau Ly <chaul@amperecomputing.com>
Date: Mon, 5 May 2025 03:28:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] platform-mc: Parse File Descriptor PDR

This commit supports parsing File Descriptor PDRs for each terminus,
and build the file information map for that terminus. This map also
holds information about the organization of the files, represented
through the file path hierarchy. The map will later be used to
construct file objects on D-Bus.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/82342]

Change-Id: I5d602ba732065a47874280d71f8c38860119b041
Signed-off-by: Chau Ly <chaul@amperecomputing.com>
(cherry picked from commit 14051a68055765bc06ead48dc7c13e92fe5da442)
---
